          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "પરમદિવસ (paramdivas) is param, \"the day after tomorrow\", with divas, \"day\" (CDIAL 6333). CDIAL has no entry for Gujarati param, so its origin is not settled; the Sanskrit word for that day was paraśvas (CDIAL 7799j)."
            }
